### 3.3 Subject

#### 3.3.1 Create Subject
POST http://localhost:9091/api/subjects
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <JWT>

{
  "data": {
    "subjectCode": "",
    "name": "",
    "credit": 0,
    "teacher": null
  }
}

#### 3.3.2 Get all Subject
GET http://localhost:9091/api/subjects?populate=*
Authorization: Bearer <JWT>

#### 3.3.3 Update Subject
PUT http://localhost:9091/api/subjects/:id
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <JWT>

{
  "data": {
    "subjectCode": "",
    "name": "",
    "credit": 0,
    "teacher": null
  }
}

#### 3.3.4 Delete Subject
DELETE http://localhost:9091/api/subjects/:id
Authorization: Bearer <JWT>

#### 3.3.5 Get Subject by ID
GET http://localhost:9091/api/subjects/:id?populate=*
Authorization: Bearer <JWT>
